metal: tile 1-D im2col by contiguous output columns

The previous dispatch launched a threadgroup for every (input channel, output
position), often with only 3-11 threads. Tile columns across channels instead,
using the existing argument layout for arbitrary batch, stride and dilation.
The 2-D path and f32/f16 output storage remain supported.

